        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis exciting new development in Lixnaw offers the opportunity to enjoy modern, energy-efficient living in the heart of North Kerry. Surrounded by beautiful countryside and a welcoming community, The Green combines peaceful village life with easy access to Listowel, Tralee and everyday amenities.\n\nDesigned for first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to put down roots, these A-rated homes offer quality, comfort and contemporary living in a location that truly feels like home.\n\nEach home at The Green is built to a high standard, achieving an A2 BER rating with modern, energy-efficient technology designed to provide year-round comfort and lower running costs.\nBright, spacious interiors, open-plan living areas and quality finishes create stylish, practical spaces designed around everyday life.\n\nLife in Lixnaw offers the charm and slower pace of village living, surrounded by the beautiful North Kerry countryside. With local amenities close at hand and plenty of open space to enjoy, it's an ideal setting for those looking for a comfortable, relaxed place to call home.\nEnjoy peaceful village living without feeling far from everything. Lixnaw is conveniently located between Listowel and Tralee, offering easy access to a wider choice of shops, schools, restaurants, services and employment making everyday life that little bit easier."
      },
